data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nI'm so sorry it's been that bad. Don't do it impulsively,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" though—call me tonight and let's talk through an exit plan first.\n\n## 2\n\nYou don't need NASA photos"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" to know it's round. Ships dipping over the horizon, different stars visible across hemispheres, and the circular shadow during"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" lunar eclipses all prove curvature directly.\n\n## 3\n\nSunlight looks white, but it’s actually a mix of all rainbow"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" colors. Blue light travels in small, short waves that easily collide with gases in our atmosphere and scatter in every direction, filling"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the whole sky with blue.\n\n## 4\n\n夜色深沉，细雨无声地笼罩了"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"整座城市。路灯下，雨丝泛着昏黄的光晕，织成一片朦胧的水雾"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"。屋檐滴滴答答地响着，打破了长夜的寂静。街道空无一人，湿漉"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"漉的柏油路倒映着模糊的霓虹。冷风夹杂着潮湿的泥土气息"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"漫进窗台，整个世界仿佛都在这淅淅沥沥的雨声中沉沉睡去。\n\n## "}}

